        "node_id": "n_4_15567f",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach of analyzing the geometric series pattern was incorrect. Instead, we should focus on the relationship between the stolen chocolates and the number of ways. The key insight is that the sum of the stolen chocolates for all possible ways should equal m, multiplied by 4 (since there are four thieves). This allows us to solve the problem more directly by finding the smallest n that satisfies this condition.",
