        "node_id": "n_7_47ce03",
        "thought_text": "Instead of iterating through all possible combinations of chocolates for each thief, we can use a mathematical approach to calculate the number of ways more efficiently. By observing the pattern of ways as n increases, we can derive a formula that allows us to calculate the number of ways for any given n in constant time, significantly reducing the time complexity and avoiding the TLE error.",
